{"parse": {"title": "香脆树枝", "pageid": 69147, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"香脆树枝\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b6/Item-270006.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"香脆树枝\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>香脆树枝</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#270006</div></div><hr /><div>一束树枝，小火烘烤至香脆可口。可在荒原中投喂给魔精，回复情绪值。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">神秘术很好地保存了它们刚砍下来时的风味——斧头的灼热，还有鲜切枝条的香气。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">毛绒臻选</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "香脆树枝"}}